# What stays local inside .aep/ is defined by .aep/.gitignore, which the
# installer writes: position/ and worktrees/.

# This repository's own .aep/ is installed from src/ only at a release, so its
# .aep/.gitignore can lag src/gitignore. Scratch is ignored here as well, so a
# run's notes and ledgers are never committed by mistake in the meantime.
.aep/scratch/
